</section>
</section>
<section id="S5" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">5. </span>Analysis</h2>

<div id="S5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we first analyze the agreement between the oracle and human PTKB selection, and then compare how the judgment pool can bias the performance of both BM25 and ANCE retrieval on iKAT 2023 and iKAT 2024.</p>
</div>
